{"id":113512834,"slug":"drug-shortage-endless-open-comment","title":"Drug Shortage Endless Open Comment Period: A Newsletter Experiment","subtitle":"A physician-journalist solicits ongoing reports of drug shortages","post_date":"2023-04-08T16:25:17.113Z","audience":"everyone","type":"newsletter","canonical_url":"https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/p/drug-shortage-endless-open-comment","wordcount":100,"source":"api","fetched_at":"2026-09-13T21:59:48.534Z","body_sha256":"e2862fa348c18db74f3053382bfb9483d42b7a09291da3503ab23f786b0fc5b6","text_words":104,"complete":true,"body_html":"<p>We have heard that stimulant shortages are a thing.  Most of theses shortages are noted on an individual level.  Every parent, every doctor each experiences their own problems.  But what if we had an open comment period that never ended?  Let’s bend the matrix.</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!VlB-!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb62aff01-3b49-4319-8f6d-b66618d55df3_3072x2048.jpeg\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!VlB-!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb62aff01-3b49-4319-8f6d-b66618d55df3_3072x2048.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!VlB-!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb62aff01-3b49-4319-8f6d-b66618d55df3_3072x2048.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!VlB-!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb62aff01-3b49-4319-8f6d-b66618d55df3_3072x2048.jpeg 1272w, https